{"path":"eval/cases/comprehende-67/expected.md","ref":"41adb309df1d25389e80787bfcd834719986a4a8","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":1,"text":"# comprehende-67: Publish PR reviews to GitHub Pages"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":3,"text":"PR #67. No ticket. A Bugbot comment (fixed) and a conversation about the 404."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":5,"text":"## Story"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":7,"text":"- Title: the PR title."},{"sha":"36849a9a33a0d1c7e4464c7c507d34cc16c19a4c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790350805,"line":8,"text":"- Why: either. The PR says reviews move from VibeDrop to this repo's GitHub Pages, but no source says why VibeDrop is dropped. A why may restate the move. It must not invent a reason for leaving VibeDrop."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":9,"text":"- Size: medium."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":10,"text":"- Parts: one story. Groups: 3 to 4."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":12,"text":"## Groups"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":14,"text":"1. Publish and prune script: `scripts/pages-review.ts`, `scripts/pages-review.test.ts`, the `test` glob in `package.json`."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":15,"text":"2. Prune workflow: `.github/workflows/pages-reviews.yml`."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":16,"text":"3. Agent flow: `.agents/skills/pages/SKILL.md`, the deleted `.agents/skills/vibedrop/SKILL.md`, `AGENTS.md`."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":17,"text":"4. `README.md`. This can merge with group 3."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":18,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":19,"text":"## Must state"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":20,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":21,"text":"- A rejected push now resets to the remote `gh-pages` tip and applies the review again. Rebase is gone, so a conflict on the root `index.html` no longer uses up the retries. This is the Bugbot fix."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":22,"text":"- The hosted URL returns 404 until GitHub Pages is turned on for the `gh-pages` branch. That is a one-time step in the repo settings."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":23,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":24,"text":"## Good to state"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":25,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":26,"text":"- A site folder without `published.json` counts as published in 1970. The next daily prune deletes it."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":27,"text":"- The comprehende skill does not change. Publishing stays in this repo (commit `9db4afb`)."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":28,"text":"- The README paragraph describes how this repo hosts reviews, not tool behavior. `AGENTS.md` says the README is for people who use the tool."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":29,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":30,"text":"## Must not"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":31,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":32,"text":"- Do not claim the comprehende skill publishes to Pages."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":33,"text":"- Do not make separate groups for the tests or for the `package.json` test glob."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":34,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":35,"text":"## Baseline"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":36,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":37,"text":"- 6 of 6 runs stated both claims."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":38,"text":"- 0 of 6 noted the 1970 rule."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":39,"text":"- Runs made 4 to 6 groups. 3 of 6 gave the test glob its own group, and 6 of 6 gave the tests their own group."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":40,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":41,"text":"## case.json"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":42,"text":""},{"sha":"36849a9a33a0d1c7e4464c7c507d34cc16c19a4c","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790350805,"line":43,"text":"- Removed the `why` expect."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":44,"text":"- `parts` max 3 to 2."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":45,"text":"- `together`: the script and its test."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":46,"text":"- Clarified the retry claim."}]}
